@startuml F5.14-D02-encerrar-evento
title F5.14-D02 — Encerrar evento
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Secretaria" as Sec
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "EventController" as Ctrl
participant "CloseEventUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Sec -> WebApp: Encerrar evento
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /events/{id}/encerrar
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: UPDATE CONCLUIDO
note right of UC
  CA-04: sem formative_entry
  nem certificado neste passo
end note
Postgres --> UC: OK (COMMIT)
UC --> Ctrl: ok
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200
WebApp --> Sec: evento CONCLUIDO

@enduml
